    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fa837c572a3542b392cf3d6ec0f34834",
      "statement": "The transfer protocol is receiver-ack chunking: the receiver sends EVENT_RECEIVED_CHUNK immediately on receiving a chunk, and the sender sends at most one next chunk per ack until offset reaches metaData.size — backpressure pacing the transfer.",
